hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"331","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa Abdillah ibn Umar (Allah awaridhie wawili) kwamba Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikataza wisal [kufunga mfululizo bila kufuturu]. Akaambiwa: Hakika wewe unafanya wisal? Akasema: ((Hakika mimi si kama nyinyi: hakika mimi nalishwa na kunyweshwa))."
"332","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa Abu Hurayrah (Allah amridhie) kwamba Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) amesema: ((Jiepusheni na wisal, jiepusheni na wisal, jiepusheni na wisal)). Wakasema: Hakika wewe unafanya wisal, ewe Mtume wa Allah? Akasema: ((Hakika mimi si kama hali yenu: hakika mimi nalala Mola wangu akinilisha na kuninywesha))."
"333","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa Anas ibn Malik (Allah amridhie) amesema: Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alifanya wisal, nao [Masahaba] wakafanya wisal, ikamfikia Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) [habari hiyo], akasema: ((Lau kuwa mwezi ungeongezewa kwangu, ningefanya wisal ambayo wenye kupituka mipaka wangeacha kupituka kwao, hakika mimi si kama nyinyi: hakika Mola wangu hunilisha na kuninywesha))."
